<title>HONG KONG: Shangri-La Asia 1996 net up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Shangri-La Asia 1996 net up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)		71.76  vs  66.43</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	 15.0   vs  15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,090.36  vs  860.42</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,015.11  vs  2,247.49</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shangri-La Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 30 to June 6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Shangri-La Asia, the hotel arm of Malaysia's Kuok Group, has hotels and investment properties in China and Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 30 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 15 cents) vs 30 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
